 "caveats": [
  "These are Cloudflare costs only. They exclude the generation pipeline, which runs in GitHub Actions and is unchanged.",
  "CPU per render is an estimate, not a measurement from inside the isolate. Read the real p50 from Workers observability and re-run with ATLAS_CPU_MS set before quoting the CPU line.",
